&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Engineered Arts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineered Arts is the leading manufacturer of full-size humanoid robots used for entertainment, education and communication. With 20 years of hardware and software development, our robots have been sold in over 30 countries worldwide with customers such as NASA, PwC, Meta and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
