&lt;p&gt;We are a team of dedicated engineers and creatives striving to develop the very best experiences for our customers. Our internal motto is &#39;Be Wow&#39;, everything we do is fun, entertaining or surprising to encounter. We always push the boundaries of what is possible in humanoid robotics, researching and developing new systems and techniques to further their appeal. We explore and challenge the human perception of robots as well as the fear and discomfort and the excitement and joy life-like mechanical humanoids present.&lt;/p&gt;
